   * statement), `removed`, `meaning`, `ghost`; `not-proved` `missing` / `axiom` / `sorry` / `mismatch` / `conditional` /
   * `unchecked`; `new-axiom` `belief` / `after-freeze`; `build` `not-built`.
   */
  token?: string;
}

